   "headline": "Tropical Low 01U lies well west of Cocos (Keeling) Islands. No direct impacts are expected.",
   "discussion": "Tropical Low 01U lies over the Indian Ocean, and is forecast to turn towards the west on Sunday. It will remain well to the west of the Cocos (Keeling) Islands, with no direct impacts expected.\n\nThe more likely scenario is that gales develop only in the southwest quadrant of the system, before it then weakens during Sunday.",
